# Station gossip companion. The image runs only `serve`; schedule these on the host.
# Times assume the station timezone. Code lives in /app; persistent state is /workspace.
# Daily refresh replaces the active slate. Use seed only when you mean to append.
0 4 * * * cd /app && node src/cli.js refresh --base-dir /workspace
# Optional append-only seed (does not replace existing tidbits):
# 0 4 * * * cd /app && node src/cli.js seed --base-dir /workspace
# Recurring spoken-event ingestion
*/5 * * * * cd /app && node src/cli.js ingest-spoken --base-dir /workspace
